---
title: "Kuza Cave & Seaweed Farm"
description: "Descend into Kuza Cave's freshwater caverns near Jambiani, then visit a working seaweed farm to learn about Zanzibar's second-largest export crop."
permalink: "/tours/kuza-cave-seaweed/"
tour_slug: "kuza-cave-seaweed"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="" id="main-content">
  <section class="tour-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5e3c 0%, #a67c52 100%);">
    <div class="tour-hero-content">
      {% set featured = page.inputPath | featuredImage %}
{% set cdnSrc = page.inputPath | cdnImage %}
<img src="{{ cdnSrc }}" alt="{{ featured.featuredAlt or page.title }}" class="tour-hero-image" loading="lazy">

      <span class="card-badge badge-nature">NAT — Nature Activity</span>
      <h1>Kuza Cave + seaweed farm</h1>
      <p class="tour-meta">3–5 hours · Jambiani / Paje</p>
      <div class="tour-price-box">
        <span class="price-label">From</span>
        <span class="price-amount">{% catPrice "kuza-cave-seaweed" %}</span>
        <span class="price-note">per person</span>
      </div>
      <button type="button" data-sns-booking-open data-service-slug="{{ tour_slug }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Check price &amp; book</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "tour-booking-panel.njk" %}

  <div class="tour-grid">
    <div class="tour-main">
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Descend into Kuza Cave — a series of freshwater caverns near Jambiani — then visit a working seaweed farm to learn about Zanzibar's second-largest export crop.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>What to Expect</h2>
        <ul class="expect-list">
      <li>3–5 hour experience combining cave exploration and farm visit</li>
      <li>Swim in natural freshwater pools inside the limestone cave system</li>
      <li>Seaweed farm demonstration — learn about cultivation and processing</li>
      <li>Hands-on participation: harvest seaweed or try traditional dyeing</li>
      <li>Traditional lunch with local family</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Duration & Meeting Point</h2>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 3–5 hours (half day)</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting point:</strong> Jambiani or Paje area (pickup from nearby hotels included)</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Important Notes</h2>
        <ul class="notes-list">
      <li>Tide-dependent — cave access varies with water levels</li>
      <li>Bring a towel and change of clothes</li>
      <li>Flashlights provided for the cave portion</li>
      <li>Community-run; part of the fee supports local cooperatives</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Inclusions</h2>
        <ul class="includes-list">
      <li>Cave entry & fresh water swim, local guide, village/seaweed center visit (optional beachside lunch available locally)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% include "tour-reviews.njk" %}

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Physical Demand & Requirements</h2>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #00667c;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">💪 Physical Demand: Moderate</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Cave swim (ladder/stairs) + seaweed farm walk. Tide-dependent access.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">👶 Age Guidelines</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Age 6+ for cave swim; all ages for cultural portion</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #9c27b0;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">👥 Group Size</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Private: 1–8</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;background:#f0f9ff;border-left:4px solid #00667c;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;">☁️ Weather Policy</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Tide-dependent access; rain or shine for cultural portion.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">🎒 What to Bring</h3>
            <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.25rem;line-height:1.8;">
              <li>Swimwear under clothes</li>
              <li>Towel & change of clothes</li>
              <li>Water shoes</li>
              <li>Flashlight (provided)</li>
              <li>Cash for local crafts</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">📍 Meeting Point</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Jambiani village (hotel pickup included)</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">⏱️ Duration</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">3–5 hours</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;background:#fff3e0;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;">⚠️ Cancellation & Booking Policy</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Free cancellation up to 24 hours before. Tide-timing dependent.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      {% include "reviews-list.njk" %}
      {% include "tour-faq.njk" %}
    </div>

    <aside class="tour-sidebar">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>📍 Tour Details</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="label">Duration:</span><span class="value">3–5 hours (half day)</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Location:</span><span class="value">Jambiani / Paje</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Category:</span><span class="value">{{ "NAT" | attractionTypeLabel }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="booking-card">
          <div class="price">{% catPrice tour_slug %} <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.85;">/ person</span></div>
          <h3>Ready to Book?</h3>
          <p style="opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Send us your preferred date and group size on WhatsApp. We'll confirm with a fixed price including all fees.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=Jambo%20Spice%20%26%20Sail%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20{{ title | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">WhatsApp: {{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}</a>
          <p class="note">✓ Verified published rate • Marine conservation fees included • Zero booking deposit</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  {% include "tour-mobile-sticky.njk" %}
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
